Package: montr-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20)
Maintainer: Montr Contributors <montr@example.com>
Description: Montr Media Playlist Server
 Web management server for the Montr distributed media
 playlist system. Provides REST API, WebSocket, and web UI
 for managing media, playlists, and client displays.
